# RUN: weft-rvv-formula-decision-test | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: nibble decision: typed g decisive, c/omega honest-null, invalid geometry rejects
# CHECK: codebook decision: fixed production 16-entry g, VLEN64 m2/VLEN128 m1/VLEN256 mf2, SEW8+32, missing and widening ceiling reject
# CHECK: repack LMUL formula/selector split: g/c construct legal set, static context honest-null, qualified winner bounded, miss-to-prior, empty set rejects
# CHECK: contraction formula/selector split: g/c/omega construct candidates and prior, qualified measurement only selects inside legality
# CHECK: repack schedule formula: loop-order and main-term candidates constructed before emission; winner bounded; SP4 fake axis absent
# CHECK: generic schedule formula: typed g/c with honest-null omega construct candidates/prior; selector winner bounded
# CHECK: low-precision formulas: typed encoding and g/c construct resource, dot-reduce, and standalone-dequant plans; invalid domains reject
# CHECK: RVV formula decision contract tests passed
